  <Overview>Seed: Syncthing on infra with staggered versioning (design: Services, rung 1; R1.41). GUI on 127.0.0.1:8384 only, behind Caddy at https://infra.seed.example.com/sync/ with its own login (vault "syncthing infra gui"). Sync on tcp/udp 22000 on the LAN; global discovery, relays and NAT traversal off. Folder "documents" = the documents share, staggered versions. Runs as nobody:users (99:100).</Overview>
